    "ciphertext": "~022079310977589420234",
    "title": "Rebuild our website content in <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> (moving from Square)",
    "description": "We have an existing website at frankiedsdonuts.com built on Square Online, and we're moving to <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span>. Our <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> store is already set up with all our products and shipping — we just need someone to bring over the website side of things: the pages, content, layout, and branding from our current Square site.\n\nWhat we need done:\n\n- Review our current website: frankiedsdonuts.com and suggest a free <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> theme that will work well. \n\n- Once theme is approved, recreate our site pages in <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span>. All those that are visible on our site plus more that are in the background (approximately 40-50 pages total including the pages that are visible online).\n\n- Move over all the text and images from the current Square site.\n\n- Build the homepage and navigation to match (or improve on) how our Square site looks now\n\n- Match our branding — fonts, colors, overall look and feel\n\n- Make sure everything displays properly on desktop and mobile\n\n- Once draft is complete, point the frankiedsdonuts.com domain to <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> once it's ready and confirm the site is live with no broken links\n\nWhat you should have:\n\nSolid <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> experience, especially theme setup and page building\nAn eye for matching existing branding\nClear communication, and a quick walkthrough at handoff so we can update the site ourselves afterward\n\nPlease share examples of <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> sites you've built or customized. Let us know your estimated timeline and whether you'd do this fixed price or hourly.",
