        "contractorTier": "EXPERT",
        "description": "We have an existing website at frankiedsdonuts.com built on Square Online, and we're moving to Shopify. Our Shopify store is already set up with all our products and shipping — we just need someone to bring over the website side of things: the pages, content, layout, and branding from our current Square site.\n\nWhat we need done:\n\n- Review our current website: frankiedsdonuts.com and suggest a free Shopify theme that will work well. \n\n- Once theme is approved, recreate our site pages in Shopify. All those that are visible on our site plus more that are in the background (approximately 40-50 pages total including the pages that are visible online).\n\n- Move over all the text and images from the current Square site.\n\n- Build the homepage and navigation to match (or improve on) how our Square site looks now\n\n- Match our branding — fonts, colors, overall look and feel\n\n- Make sure everything displays properly on desktop and mobile\n\n- Once draft is complete, point the frankiedsdonuts.com domain to Shopify once it's ready and confirm the site is live with no broken links\n\nWhat you should have:\n\nSolid Shopify experience, especially theme setup and page building\nAn eye for matching existing branding\nClear communication, and a quick walkthrough at handoff so we can update the site ourselves afterward\n\nPlease share examples of Shopify sites you've built or customized. Let us know your estimated timeline and whether you'd do this fixed price or hourly.",
